    {
      "subId": "4133425",
      "subQuestName": "Meet Mr. Zhu the following afternoon (12:00 – 18:00)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413342501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413342501": {
            "id": "413342501",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Right this way, please. Everything's already been prepared, so please have a seat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342502"
            ]
          },
          "413342502": {
            "id": "413342502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Mr. Zhu, who are these two...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342503"
            ]
          },
          "413342503": {
            "id": "413342503",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Ah yes, I was just out attracting guests when I ran into these two.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342504"
            ]
          },
          "413342504": {
            "id": "413342504",
            "speakerId": 2405,
            "speakerName": "Jianqiu",
            "text": "That's right, this lady is from Minghua Bank, and I'm one of the bank employees.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342505"
            ]
          },
          "413342505": {
            "id": "413342505",
            "speakerId": 2405,
            "speakerName": "Jianqiu",
            "text": "The lady and I were just setting off on a distant journey at the start of the Lantern Rite. I'm afraid she feels a little homesick...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342506"
            ]
          },
          "413342506": {
            "id": "413342506",
            "speakerId": 2405,
            "speakerName": "Jianqiu",
            "text": "So we decided to find a spot to watch the Xiao Lanterns, which is when we happened to meet Mr. Zhu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342507"
            ]
          },
          "413342507": {
            "id": "413342507",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Yes, and it just so happens that we've just prepared new Xiao Lanterns for the inn. Hmm... was it Minghua Bank you said? Does that mean—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342508"
            ]
          },
          "413342508": {
            "id": "413342508",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Ahem, I shan't pry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342509"
            ]
          },
          "413342509": {
            "id": "413342509",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "You two must be exhausted from your journey. Please have a rest while we prepare some food for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342510"
            ]
          },
          "413342510": {
            "id": "413342510",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Traveler, could you lend us a hand again? We'll need to quickly prepare some food for our two guests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413342511"
            ]
          },
          "413342511": {
            "id": "413342511",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Please prepare a serving of Delicious Jewelry Soup. I'll be sure to compensate you accordingly once things are all settled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133412",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Mr. Zhu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413341201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413341201": {
            "id": "413341201",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Strange, very strange indeed. I wonder what the matter is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341202"
            ]
          },
          "413341202": {
            "id": "413341202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341203"
            ]
          },
          "413341203": {
            "id": "413341203",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Hardly any guests came at all yesterday... How could that be? There should be loads of travelers for the festival...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341206"
            ]
          },
          "413341206": {
            "id": "413341206",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "No, that can't be it... There must be something wrong with the way I'm trying to attract guests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341207"
            ]
          },
          "413341207": {
            "id": "413341207",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Perhaps it'd be better if I attracted guests more directly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341208"
            ]
          },
          "413341208": {
            "id": "413341208",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "Traveler, could you please go around and attract some guests for me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341209"
            ]
          },
          "413341209": {
            "id": "413341209",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "You can mention that we have good food, nice rooms, and an excellent view for the Lantern Rite festival.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341210"
            ]
          },
          "413341210": {
            "id": "413341210",
            "speakerId": 2430,
            "speakerName": "Mr. Zhu",
            "text": "I'll keep thinking if there are any other ways we can attract some guests..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133413",
      "subQuestName": "Send out invitations to nearby people",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413341301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413341301": {
            "id": "413341301",
            "speakerId": 2121,
            "speakerName": "Zhenxiang",
            "text": "Hello. Please wait while we perform a routine inspection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341302"
            ]
          },
          "413341302": {
            "id": "413341302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Would you like to stay at Mr. Zhu's inn?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341303"
            ]
          },
          "413341303": {
            "id": "413341303",
            "speakerId": 2121,
            "speakerName": "Zhenxiang",
            "text": "Oh? Yes, I have in fact heard about Mr. Zhu's inn.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341304"
            ]
          },
          "413341304": {
            "id": "413341304",
            "speakerId": 2121,
            "speakerName": "Zhenxiang",
            "text": "But I'm on duty now. I appreciate your kind offer, but I'm afraid I cannot just abandon my post."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133414",
      "subQuestName": "Send out invitations to the people in the area",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413341401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413341401": {
            "id": "413341401",
            "speakerId": 2417,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Liu",
            "text": "Hmm? What is it, youngster?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341402"
            ]
          },
          "413341402": {
            "id": "413341402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Would you like to stay at Mr. Zhu's inn?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341403"
            ]
          },
          "413341403": {
            "id": "413341403",
            "speakerId": 2417,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Liu",
            "text": "Oh, Mr. Zhu... Yes, I know the place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413341404"
            ]
          },
          "413341404": {
            "id": "413341404",
            "speakerId": 2417,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Liu",
            "text": "But I'm afraid that his inn is simply too far from here. These old legs couldn't handle such a journey, sorry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
